Enable repository-scoped authentication on the bundled registry

Usage:
  mcp-runtime registry enable-auth [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run                  Inspect targets without changing resources or creating credentials
  -h, --help                     help for enable-auth
      --pull-namespace strings   Runtime namespaces to provision (default: all existing managed namespaces)
      --realm string             Public HTTPS platform token URL ending /api/v1/registry/token
      --test-mode                Allow a local HTTP token realm for disposable tests

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
